+//   hard bound: past it writes fail with a quota error. A game that keeps ~1.7 GB in OPFS
+//   (nfsu2.xyz's preload) fits as long as the drive has a few GB free.
+// - all sites together at most 32 GiB, and at most what they held at the first eviction check
